    "转换音频" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Convert Audio"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"转换音频"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Audio konvertieren"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Convertir audio"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Convertir l’audio"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"音声を変換"}}}},
    "转换所选歌曲" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Convert Selected Songs"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"转换所选歌曲"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ausgewählte Titel konvertieren"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Convertir canciones seleccionadas"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Convertir les morceaux sélectionnés"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"選択した曲を変換"}}}},
    "转换只处理 App 管理的本地无损音频。共享同一文件的 CUE 歌曲会一起更新，原歌曲资料、收藏和播放记录会保留。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Conversion applies to lossless audio managed by the app. CUE tracks sharing one file are updated together while their metadata, favorites, and play history are retained."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"转换只处理 App 管理的本地无损音频。共享同一文件的 CUE 歌曲会一起更新，原歌曲资料、收藏和播放记录会保留。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Die Konvertierung verarbeitet nur lokale, verlustfreie Audiodateien, die von der App verwaltet werden. CUE-Titel mit derselben Datei werden gemeinsam aktualisiert. Metadaten, Favoriten und Wiedergabeverlauf bleiben erhalten."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"La conversión solo procesa audio local sin pérdida gestionado por la app. Las pistas CUE que comparten un archivo se actualizan juntas, conservando sus metadatos, favoritos e historial de reproducción."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"La conversion traite uniquement les fichiers audio locaux sans perte gérés par l’app. Les pistes CUE partageant un fichier sont mises à jour ensemble ; leurs métadonnées, favoris et historique de lecture sont conservés."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"変換対象はAppが管理するローカルのロスレス音声のみです。同じファイルを共有するCUEの曲はまとめて更新され、曲の情報、お気に入り、再生履歴は保持されます。"}}}},
    "分析可转换项目" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Analyze Convertible Items"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"分析可转换项目"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Konvertierbare Elemente analysieren"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Analizar elementos convertibles"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Analyser les éléments convertibles"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"変換可能な項目を分析"}}}},
    "转换任务" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Conversion Tasks"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"转换任务"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Konvertierungsaufgaben"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tareas de conversión"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tâches de conversion"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"変換タスク"}}}},
    "开始转换？" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Start Conversion?"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"开始转换？"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Konvertierung starten?"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"¿Iniciar conversión?"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Démarrer la conversion ?"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"変換を開始しますか？"}}}},
    "开始转换" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Start Conversion"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"开始转换"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Konvertierung starten"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Iniciar conversión"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Démarrer la conversion"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"変換を開始"}}}},
    "每个成功转换的物理文件会替换资料库中的旧文件；失败或取消的项目继续使用原文件。正在播放的旧文件会在播放释放后再清理。" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Each successfully converted file replaces its old library file. Failed or cancelled items keep the original, and a file in use by playback is removed only after playback releases it."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"每个成功转换的物理文件会替换资料库中的旧文件；失败或取消的项目继续使用原文件。正在播放的旧文件会在播放释放后再清理。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Jede erfolgreich konvertierte Datei ersetzt die alte Datei in der Mediathek. Bei Fehlern oder Abbruch bleibt die Originaldatei erhalten. Eine gerade abgespielte alte Datei wird erst entfernt, wenn die Wiedergabe sie freigibt."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cada archivo convertido correctamente reemplaza el antiguo en la biblioteca. Los elementos fallidos o cancelados conservan el original. Un archivo antiguo en reproducción solo se elimina cuando la reproducción lo libera."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Chaque fichier converti avec succès remplace l’ancien dans la bibliothèque. Les éléments en échec ou annulés conservent le fichier original. Un ancien fichier en cours de lecture n’est supprimé qu’une fois libéré par la lecture."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"変換に成功したファイルはライブラリ内の古いファイルを置き換えます。失敗またはキャンセルした項目は元のファイルを使用し続けます。再生中の古いファイルは、再生で使われなくなってから削除されます。"}}}},
    "分析结果" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Analysis"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"分析结果"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Analyseergebnis"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Resultado del análisis"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Résultat de l’analyse"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"分析結果"}}}},
